---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Ashish Koka — ME Computer Science student at University of Cincinnati, software engineer, and IEEE-published researcher."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero__label reveal">
        <span class="section-label">About</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="about-hero__title reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Building software<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">that holds up.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-body">
    <div class="container about-body__grid">
      <div class="about-body__content prose reveal">
        <p>I am Ashish Koka — a software engineer and graduate student in Computer Science at the University of Cincinnati. I completed my B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering at SRM University AP (CGPA 3.2/4.0), and I am now pursuing my Master of Engineering while building real projects in data engineering, systems programming, and ML.</p>
        <p>My work spans the stack: from C-level virtual memory simulators and machine learning algorithms implemented from scratch in NumPy, to full-stack analytics dashboards deployed on Azure SQL. I have also published research at IEEE on applying deep learning to medical prediction problems.</p>
        <p>I care about understanding things at a level below the abstraction. That is why I implement SMO before I use sklearn, and why I build the VM manager before I study the OS page-replacement chapter.</p>
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <p>I interned as a Software Engineer at IntegrAuth, working with authentication, authorization, and identity access management tools. Before that, I completed a Salesforce Developer internship. Outside engineering, I worked as a Front Desk Assistant at the University Sports Association.</p>
        <h2>Research</h2>
        <p>I published a paper at IEEE titled "Deep Learning Approach on Prediction of Tinnitus" — applying deep learning to EEG data to predict treatment outcomes for tinnitus patients.</p>
        <h2>Outside of code</h2>
        <p>I was a member of the SRMAP movie club management team and helped supervise short film competitions. I have coordinated stalls at university fests and events.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-body__sidebar">
        <div class="about-card card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h3 class="about-card__heading">Education</h3>
          <ul class="about-card__list">
            <li class="about-card__item edu-item">
              <span class="edu-item__degree">ME Computer Science</span>
              <span class="edu-item__school">University of Cincinnati</span>
              <span class="edu-item__year tag">In Progress</span>
            </li>
            <li class="about-card__item edu-item">
              <span class="edu-item__degree">BTech CSE · 3.2 GPA</span>
              <span class="edu-item__school">SRM University AP</span>
              <span class="edu-item__year tag">2020 – 2024</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <h3 class="about-card__heading">Stack</h3>
          <ul class="about-card__list">
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>Python · NumPy · Scikit-learn</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>JavaScript · HTML · CSS</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>Flask · Streamlit</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>Azure SQL · SQLAlchemy</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>C · Systems Programming</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>Git · GitHub Actions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card card reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <h3 class="about-card__heading">Certifications</h3>
          <ul class="about-card__list">
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>HackerRank — Problem Solving (Intermediate)</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>HackerRank — SQL (Intermediate)</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>NPTEL — Cognitive Psychology</li>
            <li class="about-card__item"><span class="about-card__dot">▸</span>NPTEL — Environment and Development</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero { padding-top: var(--space-16); padding-bottom: var(--space-12); }
  .about-hero__label { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .about-hero__title { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .about-body { padding-block: 0 var(--space-24); }
  .about-body__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px; gap: var(--space-16); align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .about-body__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .about-card { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .about-card__heading { font-size: var(--text-sm); font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .about-card__list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }
  .about-card__item { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .about-card__dot { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.6em; }
  .edu-item { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); padding-bottom: var(--space-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .edu-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .edu-item__degree { font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semi); color: var(--text); }
  .edu-item__school { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edu-item__year { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: var(--space-1); }
</style>
